# Plan: card_images.json sebagai Config Dinamis Background Card (CDN jsDelivr)

## Goal

Background card WOTD (dan card lain nanti) diambil dari config JSON yang di-host di repo `data` via jsDelivr, jadi asset bisa diganti tanpa release APK dan tanpa menyentuh worker/API.

## Current Context / Assumptions

- Repo `data` (`git@github.com:sambasku/data.git`, branch `main`) sudah ada di workspace `sambasku/data/`. Isi `home/`:
  - `card_images.json` — file KOSONG (0 byte, baru dibuat user).
  - `wotd_cover.webp` — 600×338, 37 KB (sudah dioptimasi, sama dengan asset mobile).
  - Keduanya **belum di-commit** (`git -C data status` → `?? home/`).
- jsDelivr belum bisa melayani (belum di-push): `curl -sI https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/sambasku/data@main/home/card_images.json` → 404. Setelah push → 200.
- Mobile (`sambasku/mobile`, branch `fix/tab-freeze`):
  - Card WOTD: `lib/features/dictionary/presentation/widgets/word_of_day_card.dart` — background pakai `AssetImage('assets/images/wotd_cover.webp')` di 2 tempat (body line ~65, skeleton line ~285).
  - `lib/core/utils/display_image_url.dart` — helper existing: URL jsDelivr dibungkus wsrv.nl untuk resize. **Tidak dipakai di plan ini** (asset sudah 600px, card kecil; langsung jsDelivr).
  - `lib/core/cache/cached_json_client.dart` + `cache_providers.dart` — cache-aside SWR L1 disk (budget 40 MB), TTL per `CacheClass` di `lib/core/cache/cache_policy.dart`. Pola pemakaian ada di `contribute_page.dart:1540-1557` (`CacheClass.referenceStatic`, TTL 24 jam).
  - `lib/shared/widgets/cached_network_image_with_fallback.dart` — widget network image dengan fallback (dipakai luas, mis. `vote_deck_word_card.dart:138`).
  - `dioProvider` — Dio dengan interceptor auth/device-id/network-monitor. Request **absolute URL** lolos tanpa rewrite host → aman untuk jsDelivr (traffic TIDAK lewat worker sambasku).
- Constraint user: (1) ganti asset tanpa release APK, (2) tidak pakai traffic worker, (3) repo `data` jadi CDN via jsDelivr.

## Architecture / Proposed Approach

`data/home/card_images.json` berisi map config card (key → imageUrl + alignment, absolute URL). Mobile punya satu provider `cardImagesProvider` yang fetch JSON itu langsung dari `cdn.jsdelivr.net` memakai `CachedJsonClient` (cache L1 + SWR, soft-fail → null), lalu widget WOTD memakai `CachedNetworkImageWithFallback` dengan fallback asset bundled `assets/images/wotd_cover.webp` (tetap dipertahankan untuk offline/gagal). Cache-busting gambar lewat query `?v=` di dalam JSON, jadi satu edit JSON mengganti gambar tanpa sentuh app.

## Schema JSON (final)

```json
{
  "version": 1,
  "cards": {
    "wotd": {
      "imageUrl": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/sambasku/data@main/home/wotd_cover.webp",
      "alignment": "bottomCenter"
    }
  }
}
```

- `imageUrl` absolute — app tidak membangun URL, boleh menunjuk host lain (ImageKit dll) tanpa ubah app.
- `alignment` salah satu: `topLeft, topCenter, topRight, centerLeft, center, centerRight, bottomLeft, bottomCenter, bottomRight`. Tidak valid/absen → `bottomCenter` (default sekarang).
- Card baru (mis. banner diskusi) = tambah key di `cards`, zero code change untuk data, app opt-in per key.

## Step-by-step Tasks

### Task 1 — Isi + commit + push repo `data`

1. Tulis `sambasku/data/home/card_images.json` dengan isi schema di atas.
2. Commit + push:
   ```bash
   cd /Users/ibnulmutaki/Development/github/sambasku/data
   git add home/card_images.json home/wotd_cover.webp
   git commit -m "feat: card_images config + wotd cover for jsDelivr CDN"
   git push origin main
   ```
3. Verifikasi (butuh 1-2 menit setelah push pertama untuk sinkronisasi jsDelivr):
   ```bash
   curl -sI 'https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/sambasku/data@main/home/card_images.json' | head -3
   # expect: HTTP/2 200 ... content-type: application/json
   curl -sI 'https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/sambasku/data@main/home/wotd_cover.webp' | head -3
   # expect: HTTP/2 200 ... content-type: image/webp
   ```

### Task 2 — DTO + parser (mobile, TDD)

File baru: `mobile/lib/features/dictionary/data/card_images_config.dart`

```dart
/// Config background card dari CDN (repo `data` via jsDelivr).
/// Soft-fail: JSON kosong/rusak → null → app pakai asset bundled.
class CardImagesConfig {
  const CardImagesConfig({required this.cards});

  /// key card (mis. 'wotd') → config-nya.
  final Map<String, CardImageEntry> cards;

  static CardImagesConfig? tryParse(Object? json) {
    if (json is! Map) return null;
    final rawCards = json['cards'];
    if (rawCards is! Map) return null;
    final parsed = <String, CardImageEntry>{};
    rawCards.forEach((key, value) {
      final entry = CardImageEntry.tryParse(value);
      if (entry != null && key is String) parsed[key] = entry;
    });
    if (parsed.isEmpty) return null;
    return CardImagesConfig(cards: parsed);
  }

  CardImageEntry? entryOf(String key) => cards[key];
}

class CardImageEntry {
  const CardImageEntry({required this.imageUrl, this.alignment = 'bottomCenter'});

  final String imageUrl;
  final String alignment;

  static const _allowedAlignments = {
    'topLeft', 'topCenter', 'topRight',
    'centerLeft', 'center', 'centerRight',
    'bottomLeft', 'bottomCenter', 'bottomRight',
  };

  static CardImageEntry? tryParse(Object? json) {
    if (json is! Map) return null;
    final url = json['imageUrl'];
    if (url is! String || !url.startsWith('https://')) return null;
    final align = json['alignment'];
    return CardImageEntry(
      imageUrl: url,
      alignment: align is String && _allowedAlignments.contains(align)
          ? align
          : 'bottomCenter',
    );
  }

  Alignment get alignmentValue => switch (alignment) {
        'topLeft' => Alignment.topLeft,
        'topCenter' => Alignment.topCenter,
        'topRight' => Alignment.topRight,
        'centerLeft' => Alignment.centerLeft,
        'center' => Alignment.center,
        'centerRight' => Alignment.centerRight,
        'bottomLeft' => Alignment.bottomLeft,
        'bottomRight' => Alignment.bottomRight,
        _ => Alignment.bottomCenter,
      };
}
```

Test baru: `mobile/test/features/dictionary/card_images_config_test.dart` (tulis DULU, run FAIL karena file belum ada — lalu buat file di atas, run PASS):

```dart
import 'package:flutter_test/flutter_test.dart';
import 'package:sambasku/features/dictionary/data/card_images_config.dart';

void main() {
  group('CardImagesConfig.tryParse', () {
    test('null/rusak/kosong → null', () {
      expect(CardImagesConfig.tryParse(null), isNull);
      expect(CardImagesConfig.tryParse('bukan-map'), isNull);
      expect(CardImagesConfig.tryParse({'cards': {}}), isNull);
    });

    test('entry valid ter-parse, alignment valid dipertahankan', () {
      final cfg = CardImagesConfig.tryParse({
        'version': 1,
        'cards': {
          'wotd': {
            'imageUrl': 'https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/x@main/a.webp',
            'alignment': 'topCenter',
          },
        },
      });
      expect(cfg, isNotNull);
      expect(cfg!.entryOf('wotd')!.imageUrl, 'https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/x@main/a.webp');
      expect(cfg.entryOf('wotd')!.alignmentValue, Alignment.topCenter);
    });

    test('imageUrl non-https / absen → entry dibuang', () {
      final cfg = CardImagesConfig.tryParse({
        'cards': {
          'wotd': {'imageUrl': 'http://insecure/x.webp'},
          'banner': {'imageUrl': 123},
        },
      });
      expect(cfg, isNull); // semua entry invalid → config null
    });

    test('alignment aneh → fallback bottomCenter', () {
      final cfg = CardImagesConfig.tryParse({
        'cards': {
          'wotd': {
            'imageUrl': 'https://x/y.webp',
            'alignment': 'kena-angin',
          },
        },
      });
      expect(cfg!.entryOf('wotd')!.alignmentValue, Alignment.bottomCenter);
    });
  });
}
```

Verifikasi:
```bash
cd /Users/ibnulmutaki/Development/github/sambasku/mobile
flutter test test/features/dictionary/card_images_config_test.dart
# expect: All tests passed! (4 test)
```

