### Task 3 — Provider fetch dari jsDelivr (mobile, TDD)

File baru: `mobile/lib/features/dictionary/presentation/providers/card_images_providers.dart`

```dart
import 'package:riverpod_annotation/riverpod_annotation.dart';

import '../../../../core/cache/cache_key.dart';
import '../../../../core/cache/cache_policy.dart';
import '../../../../core/cache/cache_providers.dart';
import '../../../../core/network/network_providers.dart';
import '../../data/card_images_config.dart';

part 'card_images_providers.g.dart';

/// URL JSON config card di repo `data` via jsDelivr.
/// LANGSUNG ke CDN, tidak lewat worker/API.
const _cardImagesJsonUrl =
    'https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/sambasku/data@main/home/card_images.json';

/// Config card dari CDN. Null = fetch gagal / belum ada cache → pakai asset.
/// CacheClass.referenceStatic (24 jam fresh + SWR) — perubahan JSON
/// terlihat paling lambat ±24 jam, tanpa traffic worker.
@riverpod
Future<CardImagesConfig?> cardImages(Ref ref) async {
  final cache = ref.watch(cachedJsonClientProvider);
  final dio = ref.watch(dioProvider);
  final key = buildCacheKey(method: 'GET', path: '/cdn/home/card_images.json');

  try {
    final data = await cache.getOrFetch(
      key: key,
      cacheClass: CacheClass.referenceStatic,
      fetch: () async {
        final resp = await dio.get<dynamic>(
          _cardImagesJsonUrl,
          options: Options(receiveTimeout: const Duration(seconds: 5)),
        );
        final body = resp.data;
        if (body is! Map) throw StateError('Envelope card_images tidak valid');
        return Map<String, dynamic>.from(body);
      },
    );
    return CardImagesConfig.tryParse(data);
  } catch (_) {
    return null; // soft-fail: offline / CDN down → asset bundled
  }
}
```

Catatan:
- `Options` perlu `import 'package:dio/dio.dart';` — tambahkan di import.
- `Ref` dari riverpod; run `dart run build_runner build -d` untuk generate `.g.dart`.
- Key `/cdn/home/card_images.json` pseudo-path L1 (bukan path API) — hanya namespace cache, kontrak `buildCacheKey` tidak membedakan.

Test: satu test apapun provider ini butuh mock Dio + cache store; mahal untuk nilai kecil. **Skip unit test provider** — perilaku inti (parsing) sudah ke-test di Task 2; perilaku network di-integrasikan uji manual Task 4. (Ponytail: kalau nanti config ini krusial, tambah test dengan `MockDio` + `ResponseCacheStore` in-memory.)

Commit: `feat(dictionary): card images provider fetch dari jsDelivr (soft-fail)`

